OL,3,GNEWSASeries of major city roads will
OL,4,Abecome 20mph zones
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 90% of Bristol's roads will soon
OL,7,Fbe 20mph, after councillors voted to
OL,8,Freduce speed limits on a series of
OL,9,Froutes across the city.
OL,11,FThe vast majority of proposed changes
OL,12,Fwere approved at a Bristol City Council
OL,13,Fmeeting on Thursday, though some with
OL,14,Fshorter 20mph sections than originally
OL,15,Fintended after opposition from
OL,16,Fcouncillors.
OL,18,FA public consultation found a majority
OL,19,Fof respondents disagreed with many of
OL,20,Fthe plans, but the council argued the
OL,21,Fplans would improve safety.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
