OL,3,GNEWSASeries of major city roads will
OL,4,Abecome 20mph zones
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chair of the council's transport
OL,7,Fcommittee said the 90 roads in question
OL,8,Faccounted for about 5% of the city's
OL,9,Fnetwork but 30% of its serious and
OL,10,Ffatal casualties. The changes are
OL,11,Fexpected to come into effect next year.
